              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na watoto wako wote watafundishwa na BWANA; na amani ya watoto wako itakuwa nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utathibitika katika haki; utakuwa mbali na kuonewa, kwa maana hutaogopa; na mbali na hofu, kwa maana haitakukaribia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tazama, yamkini watakusanyana; lakini si kwa shauri langu. Watu wo wote watakaokusanyana juu yako wataanguka kwa ajili yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tazama, nimemwumba mhunzi avukutaye moto wa makaa, akatoa silaha kwa kazi yake; nami nimemwumba mharibu ili aharibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.16"
            ]
          }
        },
